      <Val><![CDATA[Due to how Business Central posts and updates amounts in an additional reporting currency (ACY), you can't use this feature if you use ACY. Business Central converts amounts in local currency to the alternate currency, but doesn't net transactions. If you use ACY, you must manually reverse the amounts.]]></Val>
    </Str>
    <Disp Icon="Str" Expand="true" />
    <Cmts>
      <Cmt Name="Dev"><![CDATA[(LookupHint=Codeunit ERM Exch. Rate Adjmt. Customer - NamedType ReversalErr)]]></Cmt>
    </Cmts>
  </Item>
